sequenceDiagram
 participant U as UI
 participant A as API
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 participant W as Worker
 participant Q as Qwen
 U->>A: Create project, start run
 A->>D: Save snapshot and queued run
 A-->>U: 202 and run ID
 W->>D: Claim run and commit
 W->>Q: Generate from requirements
 Q-->>W: Structured response
 Note over W: ValidationRunner required before packaging
 W->>D: Save status and artifacts
 U->>A: Poll run and events
 A->>D: Read persisted state
 A-->>U: Progress or error
